        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 451913, Arched Creston Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Creston Handleset has a modern arched design that pairs nicely with the rustic sand cast bronze material from which it is made. This front door handle comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it as a single cylinder or a dummy function on your door. That includes your choice of interior trim lever or knob. The Arched Creston Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. It is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Creston Full Escutcheon Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Creston Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-450913-specifications.pdf?v=1704262356\"><b>Emtek 451913 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sandcast Bronze Creston Handleset",
                "description": "The Creston Handleset has a modern arched design that pairs nicely with the rustic sand cast bronze material from which it is made. This front door handle comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it as a single cylinder or a dummy function on your door. That includes your choice of interior trim lever or knob. The Arched Creston Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. It is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes.",
                "keywords": "Creston Sandcast Bronze Handlesets, Sandcast Bronze Creston Handlesets, Emtek 451913, Emtek 450913, EMT-451913, Emtek Creston Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, Creston Full Escutcheon Tubular Handlesets, Arched Creston Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, traditional handlesets, rustic handlesets,"
